{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CustomInventoryLocations\">Custom Inventory Locations</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"HasWhere InventoryItem InventoryItems InventoryLocation InventoryLocations Is Item Location On Settings To ToDate\"><em>Inventory locations</em> allow you to track physical spaces where your inventory items are stored. This feature is found within the <strong>Settings</strong> tab.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Businesses Is Location On Rate Storage To ToDate\">This functionality is particularly useful for businesses that operate across multiple locations or have several storage facilities, warehouses, or retail outlets.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Add And Code Edit Is Location On Port Reports Transaction Transactions\">You can add new locations, edit existing location details, or deactivate locations that are no longer in use. Each location can be assigned a unique code for easy identification in transactions and reports.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-warehouse-alt\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryLocations\">Inventory Locations</span></span></div></div></div>",
  "key": "custom-inventory-locations"
}
